## perf qwen3-14b 6.54 tok/s
$ run_shell git log -n 1 --pretty=format:%B
BUG-025 tail: compound turns corrupt fact values + ack swallows remainder

"the port is 8080 — also, what is a mutex?" banked the entire tail as
the fact value and the training ack swallowed the question. Learned
facts/rules are now bounded to a single declarative clause via
_first_clause: hard boundaries plus comma-splice only when the
post-comma tail opens a new interrogative/imperative clause (semantic
lead detectors reused; "from now on,"-style marker heads keep their
comma; list/dotted values survive). The orchestrator no longer lets the
ack short-circuit a turn with an unlearned remainder — the model lane
handles both halves.

